<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Loma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka LOMA</para>
  <para style="toc2">Loma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">LOMA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu lia Loma valisonekele kuli Kanganda Paulu ha miaka ya mukati ka makumi atanu na iuana nakutuala hamiaka makumi atanu na miaka itanu na itatu (54-58) hanima yakusemuka kua Kilistu. Te Paulu kanda aciye mukumeneka ku Loma kaha uatumine mukanda ou kuleka vaka Yesu mu Loma, kuli vaje Vayunda na vaje keti Vayunda. Ou mukanda uausonekele te acili munganda ya Kolintu omuo ha ntsimbu ije kukekuo kuakele nakukala. Paulu uasonekele linga mafuti oshe a tsiliele nakuononoka Yesu Kilistu (16-26). Livulu lia Loma liapua livulu lia seho ku vaka Yesu kuoshe na mu vintsimbu vioshe omuo ya muje mulialumbunuka muacili na muje mualitumbikilhamo Paulu mukulumbununa muacili kuovoka kuje kutuasa kukala naco kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu. Paulu naua uanungakanene Muzimbu Uacili ua Yesu Kilistu ku Litavasano Lialaja. Vakakulilongesa vavengi vakaliluisa nguavo cinimbu ca seho mu livulu eli capua 1: 16 eci cihandeka nguaco, “Kunjivu shuamua ha muzimbu uacili, omuo ukeuo nzili ya Njambi ha kuovoka kuli uoshe uje atsiliela: hakulivanga kuli Vayunda, kuhumaho kuli vaje keti Vayunda.” Mbazuvuila yakulivanga ya Loma kuhuma (1-11) inahandeka cikuma via hali Njambi, kaha mbazuvuila ya mucivali kuhuma (12-15) ili naviavingi vishika ha vuyoye vua vaka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvanautumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulu, mu mukanda uendi aputuka kuliambulula ikeye vavenia na ku vantu vaje vausonekelele (1: 1; 15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakuhatako asoneka vuyoye vua muntu na kuovoka kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu (1: 16; 11:36)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hanima yevi Paulu ahana cishika ca vuyoye vua Yesu (13: 1; 15: 13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Uamanusuile Livulu lia Loma mukuhana vimeneka ku vantu va cikungulukilo ca Loma (16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Yange Paulu, ndungo ya Yesu Kilistu na kanganda uje yahanguile nakunjisana kuli Njambi mukuambulula Muzimbu uendi Uacili.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Njambi uakulahesele laja Muzimbu Uacili kuhitila muli tunanguizi va Njambi vendi, nge muvanavisoneka mu Visoneka via Kulela. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Vinapu via Munendi, ngue ku vuyoye vuendi vua ha mavu, uasemukile ku ntanga ya Ndaviti, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>kuhitila mu Cimbembesi Uakulela Yesu vamumuesele na nzili yakama kupua Muna Njambi omo vamusanguile ku vatsi. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Kuhitila muli Yesu tuatambuile kavumbi na vunganda linga tusane vaje keti Vayunda linga vononoke kulutsilielo omuo ya lizina liendi. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Kaha neni naua munapu vamo hhakati kavaje keti Vayunda vaje vavanasana linga vakundame kuli Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Nankuma, njilinakusonekela kuli yeni voshe muli mu Loma vaje Njambi vazanga nakumisana linga mupue vantu vendi vakulela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu vamihane kavumbi na ciyulo.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo lia Cikandelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Cakulivanga, njitsatsela kuli Njambi yange kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu hali yeni voshe, omuo lutsilielo lueni lunatsimana ha mavu oshe. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Njambi ikeye mukaleho uange linga vije vioshe vinjihandeka vinapu via vusunga, Njambi uje injili nakupangela na mutima uange uoshe mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Munendi. Njambi natantekeya ngeci njikamianuka, <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>ntsimbu yoshe mu malombelo ange njikalombo nguange Njambi mu cizango cendi nga atava njije kuli yeni nakumimeneka. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Njishunguiya cikuma kumimona, linga njakumihaneko vuana vua mu Cimbembesi mukumitakamesa. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Hano njilumbununa ngeci yeni nange tuakulikolesa ha ntsimbu imolika, yeni ha lutsilielo luange kaha nange ha lutsilielo lueni.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Vavusamba vange, munapande kuvuluka ngueni vintsimbu viavingi njakele na vutumbe vuakuija oko nakumimeneka, vuno honi kuli cuma cimo cinanjivindika. Njitonda kukoka vantu hhakati keni ngue munjinalingi hhakati ka vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Njilina likongo lia vipangi hhakati ka vantu voshe, kuli Vangelengu na ava keti Vangelengu, na kuli vaka kunangula na vilema. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Nankuma, njitonda cikuma kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili nakuli yeni naua muakala mu Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nzili ya Muzimbu Uacili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Kunjesi na shuamua ya kuambulula muzimbu uacili, omuo unapu nzili ya Njambi ije ineha kuovoka kuli vaje voshe vatsiliela, hakulivanga kuli Vayunda, kaha naua na kuli Vangelengu. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Omuo muli likelio vusunga vua Njambi vanavusholola kuhitila mulutsilielo ngue muvihandeka visoneka nguavio, “Muntu uje ivanapuisa muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha lutsilielo akayoya.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu voshe vali na mulonga ku mesho a Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Vutenu vua Njambi vunasholoka kuhuma muilu nakuluisa vupi vuoshe na vilinga via kupihia via vantu vaje vilinga viavo viavipi vivindika vusunga linga keti vavutantekeye. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Omuo vije vineha nguavo linga vatantekeye Njambi vinasholoka, omuo Njambi navisholola kuli vakevo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Hume haje Njambi hatangelele mavu, vifua viendi vije kutuasa kumona, nzili yendi ya yaye na cifua cendi ca Vunjambi vinasholoka muacili, vantu vasa kuvitantekeyela mu viuma vije vianalingi Njambi. Nankuma, vantu ava kuvasa kulisambuesa kuahi. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Cipue vene vatantekeyele Njambi, vuno honi kuvamusingimikile cipue kumuhana citsatsela. Vuno honi visinganieka viavo vinapu viangoco kaha na mitima yavo yamupulungua inashulu na milima. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Vakahandeka nguavo vanapu vaka mana, vuno honi vanapu vilema, <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>kaha vanalikela kulemesa uje kekutsa, nakulemesa viuma via vifua via vuntu vije kuviekuyoya miaka yoshe na vifua via tuzila cipue tusitu cipue viakulikoka.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Nankuma, Njambi navecelela linga valinge viuma via mazilo ngue ku mashungu a mitima yavo, kaha valinga viuma via shuamua kuli umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Vanaviana kutsiliela vusunga vua Njambi, kaha vanatsiliela makuli nakulemesa nakupangela vije vianatanga Njambi kuhona kulemesa vavenia uje uavitangele, uje ivanapande kushangazala miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Omuo ha cuma eci, Njambi navecela linga valinge viuma via shuamua ngue ku mashungu avo. Cipue vampuevo vanatenguluka kulinga vilika na vamala mu ngila ya cisemua, vuno honi valinakuvilinga mu vingila vije kuviapandelemo. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Kaha mu ngila imo naua vamala vanatenguluka kulinga vilika na vampuevo mu ngila ya cisemua, vuno honi valinakulinga vukoyi na vakuavo vamala. Vamala vali nakulinga viuma via shuamua kuli umo na mukuavo, kaha ha cuma eci vanatambula fueto inavapande omuo ya vilinga viavo viavipi vije vivanalingi.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Omuo vantu ava vanaviana kuniunga vusunga vuakuivuisisa Njambi mu viyongola viavo, Njambi navecelela linga vakale na mana a api, linga valinge viuma vije kuvapandele kulinga. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Vanashulu na viuma vioshe via mazilo na vipi na lizangamena na cizindo, vanashulu na cipululu nakutsiha na luozi na makuli na lizangamena. Vakafueye, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>nakuhandeka viavipi hali umo na mukuavo, vanapu vakakuzinda Njambi, vaka likamba, vaka kulihalesa, kaha vaka kulipamba, vayongola vingila viavingi viakupangelamo vupi, kuvekuononoka visemi vavo, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>kuvekuvuisisa, kuvekuniunga vikulaheso viavo, kaha kuvekumuesa ngozi cipue kuvuila vakuavo cikeketima. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Cipuevene vatantekeya nguavo kusompa kua Njambi kuhandeka nguanguo vantu vaje vayoya mu ngila eyi vanapande kutsa, keti lika viuma evi valinakutualelelaho kulinga kuahi, vuno honi naua vacilitavasana na vaje vakakuvilinga.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kusompa ca Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Yove kavusamba kange, nkuma ukasompo vakueni ndi? Kuli yove kukuesi kusambua, cipue vene yove iya. Nga yove usompa vakueni kaha ulinga viuma vije vivalinga vakevo, ulinakulihisa yove vavenia. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Tuatantekeya ngeci kusompa ca Njambi capua ca vusunga ha vantu vaje valinga viuma via vipi. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Nkuma omo yove, muntu lika, usompa vakueni kaha naua ukalingi viuma vije vivakalingi, uayongola nguove uasa kuputumuka ku kusompa ca Njambi ndi? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Cipue ulinakukehesa ngozi yendi yakama na kulongua cendi na kusimpa cendi. Muavusunga utantekeya nguove Njambi uakala na ngozi omuo alinakueseka kukutuamenena linga utenguluke. <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Vuno honi omuo ya mutima uove uakukola nakukaluua, kaha ulinakulingisa cihiso cove linga cipue cakama ha Litangua lije omo vutenu vua Njambi nakusompa cendi ca vusunga vikasholoka. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Njambi akahana vuana ku muntu na muntu kuya kuvipangi viendi vije vianalingi. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Vamo vantu vali nakutualelelaho kulinga muacili, nakutonda vumpau na kasingimiko na muono uje kuuekutsa, kuli vakevo Njambi akavahana muono ua yaye ya yaye. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Vuno honi vamo vantu valizanga vakevo vavenia nakuviana via vusunga nakukava vije viakupihia, kaha Njambi akamuesa vutenu vuendi na matoto endi hali vakevo. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Kukakala tuyando nalamba kuli vantu voshe vaje valinga vupi, hakulivanga kuli Vayunda kaha naua nakuli Vangelengu. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Vuno honi Njambi akahana vumpau na kasingimiko na ciyulo kuli voshe vaje valinga muacili, hakulivanga kuli Vayunda kaha naua na kuli Vangelengu. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Muafua Njambi kakele nacivembulu.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Vaje keti Vayunda vaje kuvesi na lishiko lia Mosesa, valinga vupi kaha vazimbala omuo liakuhona lishiko. Vayunda vaje vali na lishiko, valinga vupi kaha vavasompa na lishiko. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Muafua keti hakuvua lika lishiko lia Mosesa ngeci vantu vavapuisa vaka vusunga kuli Njambi, vuno honi vaje vononoka lishiko lia Mosesa vakavatumbula nguavo vaka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Cilivene vaje keti Vayunda kuvakele na lishiko lia Mosesa, vuno honi vioshe vivakalingi na mana aje muaya lishiko lia Mosesa, vakevo vavenia vanapu lishiko liavo, cipuevene kuvakele na lishiko lia Mosesa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Cifua cavo cimuesa ngeci vije lishiko lia Mosesa lishika vanavisoneka mu mitima yavo. Kaha naua na vilinga viavo vimuesa ngeci viuma evi vinapu via vusunga, omuo vintsimbu vimo viyongola viavo vikavahisa kaha naua vintsimbu vikuavo vikavamena. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Kaha ngue kuya ku Muzimbu Uacili unjilinakuambulula, omu mukemo mucikafua ha Litangua lia Kusompa lije omo Njambi akahisa viyongola viavushueke via vantu voshe kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vayunda na Lishiko lia Mosesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Honi yove, nga ulitumbula yove vavenia nguove nji Kayunda, nga uajendamena ha Lishiko lia Mosesa nakulipamba hali Njambi, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>kaha unatantekeya vika Njambi atonda linga uvilinge, kaha unalilongesa ku lishiko lia Mosesa kuhangula vije vinapu vusunga, <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>kaha unatantekeya muacili ngeci yove unapu ntuama ua tupuputua, naua ceke kuli vaje vali mu milima, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>unapu umuka kusungamesa vilema, naua mulongisi ua vaje vali kunzimba. Uatantekeya muacili nguove mu lishiko lia Mosesa unauanamo mana akushula na vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Ukalongesa vakueni, nkuma vikahoni kulilongesela yove vavenia? Ukambulula nguove, “Keti muive.” Vuno honi yove vika ukevila? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Ukahandeka nguove, “Keti mulinge vupangala.” Nkuma yove vika ukalingila vupangala? Uazinda tumponia, nkuma ukevi via mu vinjivo viakulemesela tumponia ndi? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Ukalishasha ha lishiko lia Njambi, vuno honi kuuekuvuisa Njambi shuamua omo upokola lishiko liendi ndi? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Visoneka vihandeka nguavio, “Omuo yeni Vayunda, nankuma, vaje keti Vayunda vashaula Njambi.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Nga muononoka lishiko, kulovoka ceni cili na seho, vuno honi nga kumuononoka lishiko, mukapua cilivene ngue kumualovokele. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Nga vaje keti Vayunda, vaje kuvatuhukile, vononoka vije lishiko lia Mosesa lilinakushika, nkuma Njambi kakavaniungu ngue vaka kulovoka ndi? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Kaha yeni Vayunda vakamihisa kuli vaje keti Vayunda omuo mukapokola lishiko lia Mosesa, cipuevene vanamisonekelalio kaha naua muapua muvaka kulovoka, vuno honi vakevo valinakuononoka lishiko cipuevene kuvatuhukile ku cisemua. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Munima yavioshe evi, iya Kayunda ua vusunga, uje uakulovoka muavusunga? Keti muntu uje ikeye Kayunda hambanza lika, uje kulovoka cendi kunapu kua muvila lika. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Vuno honi Kayunda ua vusunga ikeye muntu uje Kayunda mukati, uje mutima uendi unalovoka, kaha eci cinapu cipangi ca Cimbembesi ca Njambi, keti ca lishiko liakusoneka. Muntu ua cifua eci Njambi amushangazala, keti vantu kuahi.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Nkuma Vayunda vanapulakana vaje keti Vayunda ndi? Cipue nkuma kulovoka cili na seho ndi? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Cuma cakama cikuma mu vingila vioshe! Mu cihela cakulivanga, Njambi uakundikile lizi liendi kuli Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Vuno honi vatihoni nga vamo vavo kuvapuile vakulongua? Nkuma eci cilumbunuka ngue Njambi keti muka kulongua ndi? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Houe keti ngoco! Njambi napande kupua ua kulongua, cipue vantu voshe vapua vaka makuli. Ngue muvasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Unapande kusholoka muka kulongua omo uhandeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">unapande kuhiana mulonga uove omo vakusompa.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Vuno honi nga vilinga vietu viakupihia vije vituli nakulinga visholola muacili vusunga vua Njambi, nkuma tuasa kuhandeka nguetu Njambi akalingi muamupi omo atuhana kashitiku ndi? (Njilinakuhandeka mucifua ca vuntu.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Houe keti ngoco! Nga Njambi keti ua kulongua, kaha vatihoni asompa vaka mavu?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Vuno honi nga makuli ange amuesa vumpau vua Njambi hakusholola vusunga vuendi muacili, omuo vika naua hanga vacinjisompa ngue muka vupi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Kaha vikahoni kumuhandekela ngueni, “Tulingeni vupi linga vucili vusholoke?” Cilivene, vantu vamo vali nakunjishaula nakunjivangeya nguavo njinahandeka cuma eci! Vakavahisa ngue mucinapandelamo.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naumo uahi Muka Vusunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Vatihoni, nkuma yetu Vayunda tunapu tuvacili kupulaka Vangelengungu ndi? Keti ngoco kuahi! Omuo njamilekele laja nguange Vayunda na Vangelengu voshe vali mu nzili ya vupi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Ngue muvasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Naumo uahi muka vusunga,<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>naumo uahi ali na mana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">cipue muka kulemesa Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Voshe vanatenguluka kuhuma kuli Njambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">voshe vanalingi vupi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">naumo uahi akalingi cuma ca vusunga.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Majui avo anashulu na vusungu vua makuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">vindaka viavo vihandeka makuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">tunua tuavo tuhandeka mezi akupihia ngue vusungu vua linoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>Hendekesi yavo inashulu na visingo via kushasha.<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Vakazambula kuvulumuna na kutsiha vakuavo,<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>mu vingila viavo muli kupihisa na kunongesa.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Ku vatantekeya ngila ya ciyulo,<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>kaha na mu mesho avo kuvekuivuila Njambi liova.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Honi tuatantekeya ngeci viuma vioshe mu lishiko viakundama kuli vaje vali mu lishiko, mukuvindika kulisambuesa kuoshe kua vantu nakuneha vantu voshe kukusompa ca Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Omuo naumo uahi napu muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi mukulinga vije lishiko litonda, vipangi via lishiko vikevio vinapu kuleka yetu linga tutantekeye nguetu tu vaka vupi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muje vati Njambi natupuisa tu vaka vusunga ku mesho endi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Vuno honi ngila ya Njambi yakupuisa vantu linga vapue vaka vusunga ku mesho endi inasholoka. Kuyesi nacimo na lishiko, cipue lishiko lia Mosesa na tunanguizi va Njambi vahanene vukaleho hali likelio. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Vusunga vua Njambi kuhitila mu lutsilielo muli Yesu Kilistu kuli voshe vaka kutsiliela. Omuo kukuesi kahangu kahi, <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>vantu voshe vanalingi vupi, kaha vakelekulahako na vumpau vua Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Vuno honi vanavapuisa vaka vusunga kuli Njambi ha vuana vua kavumbi ka Njambi kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu, uje navapatula. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Njambi uamupuisile nkombelo, linga ha nkombelo ya kutsa cendi akapue cihingo cakusambuesa vupi vua vantu halutsilielo luavo muli ikeye. Njambi ualingile cuma eci mukumuesa ngeci napu muka vusunga. Ha kulivanga Njambi uasimpile, kaha kahakeleko mutima ku vupi vua vantu, <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>vuno honi ku ntsimbu ino alinakusompa vupi vua vantu, mukumuesa vusunga vuendi. Mu ngila eyi vene Njambi alinakumuesa ngeci ikeye vavenia napu muka vusunga kaha muntu uoshe uje atsiliela muli Yesu Njambi amupuisa muka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Kaha honi kulihi naua tukalishasha? houe vene! Omuo tuononoka lishiko ndi? houe, vuno honi omuo tutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Omuo tuayongola ngeci muntu vamupuisa muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha lutsilielo lika, vuno honi keti mukulinga vije lishiko vilishika. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Cipue Njambi nkuma uapua Njambi ua Vayunda lika ndi? Nkuma kapuile Njambi ua vaje keti Vayunda naua ndi? Cilivene uapua Njambi uavoshe. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Omuo Njambi uapua umolika, kaha akapuisa Vayunda kupua vaka vusunga ku mesho endi halutsilielo luavo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Nkuma eci cinalumbunuka ngeci halutsilielo tunaviana lishiko ndi? Houe keti ngoco, vuno honi tulinakukolesa lishiko.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Cimueso ca Avilahama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Nankuma, vikahoni tuhandeka hali kukuluila yetu Avilahama? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Nga Avilahama vamupuisile muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha viuma vije vialingile, nge uapandele kulishasha, vuno honi ikeye kalishashele ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Visoneka vihandeka nguavio, “Avilahama uatsilielelele Njambi, kaha omuo ha lutsilielo luendi, Njambi uamutambuile kupua muka vusunga.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Muntu uje apanga atambula fueto, vuno honi fueto yendi kuvasa kuitumbula nguavo vuana, omuo inapu cuma cije napangela. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Vuno honi muntu uje natsiliela lika ha lutsilielo, keti ha vilinga viendi, kaha uje atsiliela kuli Njambi uje muka kusambuesa muka mulonga kupua uakuhona mulonga, kunapu kutsiliela cendi kuje Njambi ayongola linga amupuise muka vusunga ku mesho endi. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Eci cikeco calumbunuine Ndaviti omo uahandekele hakuvezika kua muntu uje Njambi namupuisa muka vusunga, kuakuhona cuma cimo cije calinga uje muntu,<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>“Vanavezika vantu vaje Njambi navasambesa ku vipi viavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">Vantu vaje vipi viavo vanavifuiki!<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Uakukuisula muntu uje Muene kakamuanukila vipi viendi!”<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Nkuma kuvezika kuje kuahandekele Ndaviti kuakundama lika kuli vaka kulovoka ndi? Cilivene kuahi! Kunakundama naua nakuli vaje vaka kuhona kulovoka. Omuo tunamono laja mu visoneka nguavio, “Avilahama uatsilielelele kuli Njambi, kaha omuo ha lutsilielo luendi Njambi uamutambuile kupua muka vusunga.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Ntsimbu mukahoni eci calingiuile? Eci calingiuile te Avilahama kanda atuhuke, keti te natuhuka laja. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Vamutuhuile, kaha kulovoka cendi kuapuile cimueso cakumuesa linga omuo hakutsiliela cendi Njambi uavatambuile kupua muka vusunga ntsimbu kanda vacimutuhule. Nankuma, Avilahama napu ishe ua voshe vaka kutsiliela kuli Njambi, kaha Njambi navatambula kupua vaka vusunga, cipue vene kuvatuhukile. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Kaha ikeye naua napu ishe ua voshe vaje vanatuhuka, keti lika kuli vaje vanatuhuka vuno honi linga vavuezeleleko mukulovoka, vayoya yoyesi yakutsiliela ije yayoyele tatetu Avilahama ntsimbu kanda vamutuhule.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cikulaheso ca Njambi vacitambula ha lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Omo Njambi uakulahesele Avilahama na vatekuluila vendi ngeci vakasuana mavu, ualingile eci, keti nge Avilahama uononokele lishiko kuahi, vuno honi uatsilielelele, kaha Njambi uamutambuile kupua muka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Omuo nga vije viakulahesele Njambi vavihana kuli vaje vononoka lishiko lia Mosesa, kaha lutsilielo lua muntu lupua luangoco, naua kaha cikulaheso ca Njambi cinapu cakuhona seho. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Omuo lishiko lineha vutenu vua Njambi, vuno honi nga kukuesi lishiko, kaha kukuesi kupokola lishiko.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Nankuma, cikulaheso cajendamenene ha lutsilielo, linga cikulaheso vapande kucikolesela kupua vuana vua Njambi kuli vatekuluila voshe va Avilahama, keti lika kuli vaje vononoka lishiko kuahi, vuno honi na kuli vaje vatsiliela nge mualingile Avilahama. Omuo Avilahama napu tate yetu voshe vaka kutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Njinakupuisa ishe ya mafuti oshe.” Nankuma, cikulaheso cinapu cacili ku mesho a Njambi, uje yatsilielelele Avilahama, Njambi uje muka kusangula vatsi, uje hakushika cendi aneha viuma vije kuviesiko linga vikaleko. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Avilahama uatsilielele nakukala na lutsilielo, cipuevene kukuakele cuma catsilielele, kaha uapuile “Ishe ya mafuti oshe.” Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Nankuma, vatekuluila vove vakapua vavengi cikuma nge vintangantanga.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Avilahama ha ntsimbu ije uakele na miaka yakupua cihita cimolika (100), vuno honi lutsilielo luendi luazeyele omo uayonguele ha muvila uendi uje uakele kuyehi na kutsa, cipue ha cuma cije ngeci Sala kasa kusema vana. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Kalitaliangelelele mukutsiliela cendi, kaha kakele na kulunienga ha cikulaheso ca Njambi, vuno honi uatsilielelele cikuma kaha uashangazalele Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Uatsilielele nguendi Njambi asa kulinga vije vianamukulahesa. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Omu mukemo Avilahama ha lutsilielo luendi, vamutambuile kupua muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Mezi aua a “Vamutambuile kupua muka vusunga,” kuva asonekelele kuli ikeye lika kuahi. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Va asonekelele naua nakuli yetu kupua vaka vusunga, vaje vanatsiliela kuli Njambi uje uasanguile Muene yetu Yesu ku Vatsi. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Vamuecelele linga atse omuo vipi vietu, kaha uamusanguile linga vatupuise vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kutupuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Nankuma, omuo vanatupuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi kuhitila mu lutsilielo, kaha tuli mu ciyulo na Njambi hali Muene yetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Hali ikeye natulingisa linga tutantekeye kavumbi ka Njambi, kaje tuli nakuyoyelamo hano. Kaha tulinakulipamba ha kutsiliela kua vumpau vua Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Keti lika ovio vuno honi tuli nakulipamba ha tuyando tuetu, omuo tunatantekeya nguetu tuyando tusholola lukakateya, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>kaha lukakateya lupuisa linga muntu apue ua vilinga viacili, kaha evi vilinga vineha kutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Kaha kutsiliela eci kucasa kutuvuisa shuamua, omuo Njambi netila cizango cendi mu mitima yetu kuhitila mu Cimbembesi Uakulela, uje ikeye napu vuana vua Njambi kuli yetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Ha ntsimbu ije tuapuile tuvakuzeya, Kilistu uatsililile vaka vupi ha ntsimbu ije yahanguile Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Cinapu cuma cacikalu cikuma kuuana muntu atava kutsila muka vusunga. Cipuevene nguavo casa kupua cacasi kuuana muntu uje atava kutsila muntu uacili. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Vuno honi Njambi nasholola cizango cendi cakama kuli yetu, omo ha ntsimbu ije tuapuile tuvaka vupi kaha Kilistu uatutsililile! <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Omuo ya maninga a Yesu Kilistu, vanatupuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi, nankuma, cikahiana cikuma Kilistu kutuamena ku vutenu vua Njambi! <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Tuapuile vitozi va Njambi, vuno honi tunapu vavusamba vendi kuhitila ha kutsa kua munendi. Kaha honi omuo tunapu vavusamba va Njambi, tukovoka ha muono ua Kilistu! <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Vuno honi keti evi lika kuahi, tujolela omuo ha vije vianalingi Njambi kuhitila muli Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, uje hanohoni natupuisa vavusamba va Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa kuhitila muli Andama na Muono kuhitila muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Vupi vuezile hano ha mavu kuhitila mu muntu umolika, nankuma vupi vuendi vuanehele kutsa. Kaha kutsa kuezile ku miyati yoshe ya vantu omuo voshe vanalingi vupi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Vupi vuakele ha mavu ntsimbu kanda vahane lishiko, vuno honi kuje kukuakele lishiko, vupi kuvavutandelako. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Vuno honi kuhuma ku ntsimbu ya Andama nakuheta ku ntsimbu ya Mosesa, kutsa cayulile ha vantu voshe, cipue hali vaje kuvalingile vupi ngue mualingile Andama omo kononokele lishiko lia Njambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Andama uapuile cimueso ca uje akeja. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Vuno honi vuana vuje kuvuakele ngue vupi, omuo vuana vua Njambi kuvuakele ngue vupi vua Andama kuahi. Muavusunga vene vantu vavengi vanatsi omuo vupi vua muntu umolika. Vuno honi kavumbi ka Njambi kakama cikuma, kaha na vuana vuendi vuakuhona kupangela vuje vuanahana kuli vantu vavengi mu kavumbi ka muntu uje umolika, ikeye Yesu Kilistu vunapu naua vuakama cikuma. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Vuana vua Njambi kuvasa kuvuesekesa nge vupi vua muntu umolika. Munima ya vupi vumolika, kuezile “Kuhisa,” Vuno honi munima ya vipi viavingi, kuneja vuana vuakuhona kupangela vuje vunaneha “Kukonkama!” <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Muavusunga kuhitila mu vupi vua muntu umolika kutsa cayulile omuo ya uje muntu umolika. Vuno honi viuma vije vinasholoka vialingile uje muntu umolika, ikeye Yesu Kilistu vinahiana cikuma! Voshe vaje vanatambula kavumbi ka Njambi ka miaka yoshe ya yaye vanavapuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho endi vakayula mu muono kuhitila muli Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Nankuma, nge ha vupi vumolika vantu voshe vanavahisa, mu ngila eyi vene cipangi cimolika ca kukonkama cinapatula vantu voshe nakuvahana muono. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Kaha nge vantu voshe vavapuisile vaka vupi hakuhona kuononoka kua muntu umolika, mu ngila eyi vene voshe vakavapuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha kuononoka kua muntu umolika.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Lishiko liasholokele linga vilinga via vupi vilane, vuno honi kuje kuvualanene vupi, kavumbi ka Njambi kalanene cikuma. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Nankuma, nge omo vupi vuayulile ha kutsa, mukemo vene naua kavumbi ka Njambi kalinakuyula ha vusunga, nakututuamenena ku muono ua yaye ya yaye kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu Muene yetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kutsa kuhuma ku vupi vuno honi kuyoya muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Nankuma, vikahoni tukahandeka? Nkuma tunapande kutualelelaho kuyoya mu vupi ngeci kavumbi ka Njambi kalane ndi? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Houe keti ngoco! Tunatsi ku vupi, kaha vatihoni tuasa kuyoyelamo? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Omuo muavusunga munatantekeya ngueni omo vatumbuitikile hamo muli Kilistu Yesu, vatumbuitikile mu kutsa cendi. <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Kaha hakutumbuitika, tuatsile hamo nendi kaha vatutsindile hamo nendi, ngeci, ngue omo Kilistu vamusanguile ku vatsi na vumpau vua Ishe, ngeci netu tunapande kuyoyela mu muono uauha.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Omuo nga tunapu hamo nendi mu kutsa cendi, mu ngila eyi vene tukapua hamo nendi ha kusanguka cendi. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Kaha tuatantekeya nguetu vuntu vuetu vualaja vavushukikile hamo na Kilistu ha cilindakano, ngeci muvila ua vupi vaunongese, ngeci keti tupue naua tuvandungo va vupi. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Kaha omo tutsa, vatuzitula ku nzili ya vupi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Omuo tunatsi na Kilistu, tutsiliela nguetu tukayoya naua hamo nendi. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Omuo tuatantekeya nguetu Kilistu uasangukile ku vatsi kaha kakatsi naua kuahi, kutsa kukuesi na nzili naua hali ikeye. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Kaha omuo ikeye uatsile, kakatsiho naua ku vupi, kaha honi alinakuyoyela muli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Mu ngila eivene munapande kuanuka ngueni munatsi, kuesakesa na vupi, vuno honi muli nakuyoya muli Njambi hali Kilistu Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Keti mutave vupi vuyule mu mivila yeni ije kuye kuyoya yaye, mukuononoke mashungu auo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Cipue vilio vieni keti muviecelele ku vupi mukuvipangesa mu viuma via kuhenga-henga vuno honi likundikeni kuli Njambi, ngue vantu vaje vavahumisa ku kutsa nakuvaneha ku muono, kaha kundikeni vilio vieni vioshe kuli Njambi ngeci vavipangese mu viuma via vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Omuo vupi kuvuapandele ku miyula kuahi, omuo kumuesi nakuyoya ku Lishiko lia Mosesa kuahi vuno honi, mu kavumbi ka Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vandungo va vusunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Vatihoni tuhandeka? Nkuma tunapande kulinga vupi, omuo kutuesi ku Lishiko lia Mosesa vuno honi tuli mu kavumbi ka Njambi ndi? Houe keti ngoco.<verse eid="ROM 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Muavusunga muatantekeya ngeci omo mulikundika yeni vavenia ngue vandungo kukuononoka muntu umo, munapu mu vandungo va uje muene imuli nakuononoka, cipue ku vupi vuje vuneha kutsa, cipue hakuononoka, kuje kuneha kumipuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Vuno honi tutsatsela kuli Njambi! Omuo cipue laja muapuile mu vandungo va vupi, muononoka na mitima yeni yoshe mu vusunga vuli mu vilongesa vije vimuatambuile. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Kaha vamipatuile ku vupi, munapu vandungo va vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>(Njilinakulikuasesa mezi amasi kuuakuata omuo kuzeya kua mitima yeni ya vuntu.) Kaha ha ntsimbu imo mualikundikile vutuntu kupua vandungo va viuma via mazilo na kapenga. Kaha mu ngila eyi vene hano vene munafuila kulikundika muvamutunu kupua vandungo va vusunga ngeci mulinge viuma via kulela. <verse eid="ROM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Omo muapuile vandungo va vupi, kumuapatukile ku vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Vuno honi vikahoni muauaneneho hakulinga viuma vije vimuli nakuivuila shuamua? Fueto ya viuma vije inapu kutsa! <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Vuno honihoni vanamipatula ku vupi, kaha munapu vandungo va Njambi linga mulele kaha mukale na muono uayaye. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Kaha omuo fueto ya vupi inapu kutsa, vuno honi vuana vua Njambi vunapu muono uayaye muli Kilistu Yesu Muene yetu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Cimueso ca vulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Vavusamba vange, mua vusunga muasa kuvuisisa evi vinjihandeka kuli yeni, omuo yeni voshe muatantekeya Lishiko lia Mosesa. Lishiko lia Mosesa lili na nzili hali vantu omo valinakuyoya lika. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Mpuevo uakushomboka vanamukutu na Lishiko kuli yala liendi, omo yala liendi ali nakuyoya, vuno honi nga yala liendi atsa, kaha honi uje mpuevo napatuka ku Lishiko lije lia mukutile kuli yala liendi. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Kaha nga uje mpuevo akala na yala ueka naua omo yala liendi acili na kuyoya, kaha vamuhandeka nguavo muka vupangala, vuno honi nga yala liendi atsa, kaha akashomboka kuli yala ueka naua, ou mpuevo napatuka kapu naua muka vupangala. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Vavusamba vange, neni naua cifua cimo, neni naua mu natsi ku lishiko omuo munapu vilio via muvila ua Kilistu, kaha honi munakundama kuli ikeye, uje ivasanguile ku vatsi linga tupangele Njambi vipangi viacili. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Omuo tuayoyele mu vusitu, mashungu a vupi aje Lishiko lia Mosesa liashangumuine akele nakupanga mu mivila yetu, kaha vioshe vitualingile viatutuelele ku kutsa. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Vuno honi, tunapatuka ku Lishiko lia Mosesa, omuo tuatsile ku cije catupuisile vinzinda. Kutuesi naua nakupanga mu ngila ya laja ya Lishiko lia Mosesa lia kusoneka, vuno honi mu ngila yaiha ya Cimbembesi.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lishiko lia Mosesa na vupi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Kaha honi, tunapande kuhandeka nguetu Lishiko likelio liapua vupi ndi? Houe keti ngoco! Vuno honi liapuile Lishiko lije lianjilingisile linga njitantekeye vupi. Nga Lishiko lia Mosesa kuliahandekele ngualio, “Keti uliveyele cuma ca mukueni,” Nga ku njatantekeyele lishungu eli. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Vuno honi vupi vua uanene muhela mukushangumuna mashungu a vupi amengi muli yange. Nga Lishiko liahi, nga vupi kuvuesi na nzili. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Nange vene ha ntsimbu imo njayoyele kuakuhona Lishiko, vuno honi omo lishiko liezile, vupi vuakele na nzili, <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>kaha njatsile. Kaha Lishiko lije liapandele kuneha muono, lianehele kutsa kuli yange. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Kaha vupi vuauanene muhela, kaha mu nzili ya lishiko vupi vuanjikuisile na kunjitsiha.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Kaha Lishiko lia Mosesa likelio liapua lia kulela, naua na Lishiko liapua lia kulela na vusunga vua cili. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Vuno honi nkuma eci calumbunuka ngeci cije cacili cikeco canehele kutsa kuli yange ndi? Keti ngoco kuahi! Eci calingiuile omuo vupi, hakupangesa cije cacili, vupi vuanehele kutsa kuli yange, linga cifua cavuo cisholoke ngeci mua vusunga vunapu vupi. Kaha mu nzili ya lishiko vupi vunasholoka kupua vua vupi cikuma.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nzita mukati ketu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Tuatanekeya nguetu Lishiko lia Mosesa liapua liakucimbembesi, vuno honi yange njinapu muntu ua muvila ua ntsitu, uakulandesa ngue ndungo ku vupi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Kunjitantekeya vinjilinga, omuo kunjekulinga vije vinjitonda kulinga, vuno honi njikalingi vije njazinda. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Kaha omo nga njilinga vije kunjatondele kulinga, eci njimuesa nguange Lishiko lia Mosesa linapu lia vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Kaha keti yange vene mua vusunga njili nakulinga viuma evi, vuno honi vupi vuje vuli nakuyoya muli yange. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Omuo njatantekeya nguange kumuesi vucili muli yange, mu vuntu vuange. Cipue muli yange muli lishungu liakulinga via cili, vuno honi ku njasa kuvilinghamo. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Omuo kunjekulinga vucili vuje vunjikatondo kulinga, vuno honi njikalingi vupi vuje kutualelelaho. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Nga njilinga cije kunjatondele kulinga, eci cinalumbunuka ngeci keti yange njilinakucilinga, vuno honi vupi vuje vuli muli yange vukevuo vulinakucilinga.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Kahavene, njinauana nguange Lishiko lia Mosesa eli lilinakupanga, omo njitonda kulinga via cili, kaha haje vene vupi vusholoka. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Omuo njivuahelela mu Lishiko lia Njambi mukati ka mutima uange. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Vuno honi njimona Lishiko lieka lilinakupanga mu muvila uange, Lishiko lije lilinakuluisa Lishiko lije linjinatsiliela mu mutima uange. Linanjipuisa cinzinda ca Lishiko lia vupi lije vulinakupanga mu muvila uange. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Yange muntu uakuvindama! Iya honi akanjamena ku muvila ou unjituala ku kutsa? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Kutsatselela kuli Njambi hali Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Kaha, mukemuo munjinafu, nge lika njasa kupanga Lishiko lia Njambi na mutima uange lika, vuno honi vuntu vuange vupangela Lishiko lia vupi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Muono mu Cimbembesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Kukuesi cihiso kuli vaje vali na kuyoya muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Kaha omuo Lishiko lia Cimbembesi, lije litunehela muono muli Kilistu Yesu, linanjipatula ku lishiko lia vupi na kutsa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Njambi ualingile vije lishiko lia Mosesa liahonouele kulinga. Omuo vuntu vuakele vua kuzeya, Uahisile vupi mu vuntu hakutuma Munendi, uje uezile mu cifua ngue cetu ca vuntu, mukuhumisa vupi. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Njambi uapangele eci ngeci vilinga via vusunga via Lishiko lia Mosesa vavishulise muli yetu vaje vavali nakutuamenena mucimbembesi, keti mu vuntu kuahi. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Kaha omo vaje vanapu vaka vuntu, vayongola viuma via vuntu, vuno honi vaje vanapu vaka Cimbembesi, vayongola viuma via Cimbembesi. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Nga cizango ca vuntu cikutuamenena, kaha fueto yaco kutsa vuno honi nga cizango ca Cimbembesi cikutuamenena, kaha fueto yaco inapu muono na ciyulo. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Muntu uje akatonda via vuntu akempuka citozi ca Njambi, omuo akaviana kukavangeya mashiko a Njambi, muavusunga vene kaha akavangeya. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Kaha voshe vaje vali nakuvatuamenena ku vuntu kuvasa kuvuahelesa Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Kumuekuyoya nge muje vuntu vutonda linga muyoyemo, vuno honi muyoya ngue muje Cimbembesi mucitondelahamo, nga Cimbembesi ca Njambi cikala muli yeni. Uoshe uje kesi na Cimbembesi ca Kilistu, kaha kakundama kuli Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Vuno honi nga Kilistu ali muli yeni, cipue mivila yeni inapu ya kutsa omuo vupi, vuno honi vimbembesi vieni vilinakuyoya muli yeni omuo vanamipuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Nga Cimbembesi ca Njambi, cije casanguile Yesu ku vatsi, cikala muli yeni, kaha uje uasanguile Kilistu ku vatsi ikeye naua akahana muono ku mivila yeni ya kutsa ha Cimbembesi cendi cije cili muli yeni.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Kaha vavusamba vuange, kutuapandele ngue kuyoyela mu vuntu ngue muvuatonda vuntu vuetu kuahi. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Kaha nga muyoya ku vupi vua vuntu mukatsa, vuno honi nga ku Cimbembesi mutsihia vilinga via muvila ua vupi vua vuntu, kaha mukayoya. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Omuo voshe vaje Cimbembesi ca Njambi cilinakuvatuamenena vanapu vana va Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Kaha Cimbembesi cije canamihana Njambi camipuisile mu vandungo linga mukale na liova, vuno honi Cimbembesi cije scinamipuisa vana va Njambi, kaha na nzili ya Cimbembesi tulinakutambeka kuli Njambi nguetu, “Abba! Tatetu!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Cimbembesi ca Njambi calintavasana na Cimbembesi cetu ngeci tu vana va Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Omuo tu vana va Njambi, tukatambula vikuisulo vije Njambi natulikila vantu vendi, kaha naua tukatambula muli Kilistu vije vianamutulikila Njambi, omuo tuyanda hamo na Kilistu, kaha naua tukakala hamo nendi mu vumpau vuendi.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vumpau vua kulutue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Yange njasinganieka nguange tuyando otu tutulinakuyanda ntsimbu ino kutuasa kutuseteka na vumpau vuje vukasholoka kuli yetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Nankuma, viakutanga vioshe vili na cizango cakama cakuvandamena Njambi ngeci asholole vana vendi. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Omuo viakutanga vioshe vavihisile ngeci vipue viuma viangoco, keti ngue ku cizango cavio kuahi, vuno honi capuile cizango ca Njambi linga cipue ngacije. Vuno honi cipue ngocovene kuakele kutsiliela <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>nga viakutanga ku litangua limo vikapatuke ku vundungo vua kutsa, kaha vukakale na vumpau vuakupatuka kua vana va Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Omuo tutantekeya nguetu kuheta na ku ntsimbu ino, viakutanga vioshe vili nakulikemanga ngue mpuevo uje atonda kusema. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Vuno honi keti viakutanga lika vilinakulikemanga kuahi, netu naua tuli na Cimbembesi ngue vaje vakulivanga kupua vana va Njambi ngeci atupuise vana vendi nakupatula mivila yetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Omuo tunovoka muafua ha kutsiliela, vuno honi kutsiliela kuje kutumona kukeko keti kutsiliela, nkuma iya honi ali nakutsiliela vije vianamono? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Vuno honi nga tuli na kutsiliela vije kutuamuene, kaha hanga tucivandamena nakusimpa.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Mu ngila iyivene Cimbembesi citukuasa mukuzeya kuetu. Omuo kututantekeya muje vati tunapande kulombela vuno honi Cimbembesi cikeco cikalambelela kuli Njambi na mezi akulikemanga aje kutuasa kutumbula. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Kaha Njambi uje amona mu mitima yetu, atantekeya muviafua visinganieka via Cimbembesi omuo Cimbembesi cikalambelela kuli Njambi hali vantu vendi ngue ku cizango cendi.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Tutantekeya nguetu mu viuma vioshe Njambi akalingi muacili na vaje vamuzanga, kaha navaje vanasana ku cizango cendi. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Kaha vaje vahanguile Njambi vakevo naua vatepele kuvapuisa ngue Munendi, linga Munendi apue uakulivanga kusemuka ha vavengi vakakutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Kaha vaje vatepele Njambi, vakevo vasanene, kaha vaje vasanene, uavapuisile vaka vusunga ku mesho endi, kaha vaje vapuisile vaka vusunga ku mesho endi vakevo vahanene vumpau vuendi.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ca Njambi muli Kilistu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Kaha ha viuma vioshe evi, tukahandeka vatihoni? Nga Njambi napu uetu, kaha iya honi asa kutuluisa? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Njambi kavianene kuhana munendi umo lika, vuno honi uatueceleleye yetu voshe! Uje uatuhanene Munendi, nkuma kasa kutuhana viuma vioshe ndi? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Kaha iya honi asa kuvangeya vaje vanahangula Njambi? Njambi ikeye muka kuvapuisa vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Kaha iya asa kuvahisa? Keti Kilistu Yesu, uje uatsile, cipue uje ivasanguile ku vatsi kaha ali ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi, mukutulambelelako kuli Njambi! <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Kaha iya asa kutuhangununa ku cizango ca Kilistu? Tuyando cipue vukalu, cipue mapakeso cipue njala cipue kuhutuua, cipue vushonde, cipue kutsa ndi? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Omuo ya lizina liove tuli muvushonde vua kutsa ntsimbu yoshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">valinakutupangesa ngue vampanga vaje vaya mukuvatsihia.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Houe, mu viuma vioshe yetu tunahiana muli ikeye uje uatuzangele! <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Omuo njatantekeya nguange mua vusunga nacimo cahi casa kutuhumisa ku cizango ca Njambi, cipue kutsa cipue muono, cipue tungelo cipue vaka kusuana cipue vaka nzili vaje vakala muilu, cipue ku ntsimbu ino vene cipue ku ntsimbu ya kulutue, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>cipue cuma cili muilu, cipue cuma cili ha mavu, nacimo cahi cakutanga casa kutuhumisa ku cizango ca Njambi cije cinapu cetu muli Kilistu Yesu Muene yetu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Njambi na vantu vendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Njihandeka vusunga muli Kilistu Yesu, kaha kunjesi nakuhandeka makuli. Visinganieka viange lelo vilinakuambulula hamo nange hali Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>kaha omo njikahandeka nguange njili na vusiua vuakama cikuma, nakuvavala kuje kukuasa kuhua mu mutima uange, <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>njayonguele nguange njakele mu cisingo ca Njambi na kulitepa kuli Kilistu omuo ya vantu vange. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Kaha ava vanapu vaka Isaleli, vaje Njambi uapuisile vana vendi mukuvasholuela vumpau vuendi, ualingile litavasano navo nakuvahana Lishiko lia Mosesa, vakalemesa mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha vakatambula vikulaheso via Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Kaha vanapu vatekuluila va vakukuluila vakutsimana, na Kilistu mu vuntu vuendi, nakundama ku cisemua cavo. Njambi uje muka kuyula viuma vioshe, vamushangazalele miaka yoshe! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Kunjesi nakuhandeka nguange cikulaheso ca Njambi cinahonoua, omuo keti vantu voshe va Isaleli vapua vantu va Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Keti voshe vatekuluila va Avilahama vapua vana va Njambi kuahi. Vuno honi Njambi uahandekele kuli Avilahama nguendi, “Kuhitila muli Isake mukemuo lika mukakala na vatekuluila vaje njamikulahesele.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Eci calumbunuka ngue vana vaje vasemuka ku cisemua ca vuntu keti vana va Njambi, vuno honi vantu vaje vanasemuka omuo cikulaheso ca Njambi vakevo vavatumbula vatekuluila va vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Cikulaheso ca Njambi calishulisisile ha mezi aua nguaco, “Ha ntsimbu ino vene mungolosika njikahiluka naua, kaha Sala akasema muana ua yala.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Kaha keti eci lika kuahi. Vuno honi omuo vana va Lambeka va vamala vakele na ishavo umolika, ikeye kukuluila yetu Isake. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Omo kanda vaje vampasa vasemuke naua te kanda valinge viacili cipue viavipi, linga cizango ca Njambi cakuhangula citualeleleho, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>kaha Njambi ualekele Lambeka nguendi, “Mukuluntu akapangela shongo yendi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Njazangele Yakomba, nakuzinda Isau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Vikahoni tuhandeka? Nkuma Njambi uakahangu ndi? Houe keti ngoco. <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Kaha Njambi uahandekele kuli Mosesa nguendi, “Njikovuila cikeketima hali uoshe uje njikazanga, kaha njikevuila ngozi hali uoshe uje injitonda kuivuila ngozi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Kaha viuma vioshe kuvikundama kuli vije viatonda muntu cipue vije vialinga kuahi, vuno honi ha cikeketima ca Njambi lika. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo Njambi uahandekele kuli muene ua Ingito nguendi, “Njakupuisile muene linga njikupangese mukusholola nzili yange nakunjitsimanesa mu lifuti lioshe.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Kaha honi, Njambi ali na cikeketima hali uoshe yatonda, kaha akaluuisa mitima ya uoshe uje yatonda.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vutenu vua Njambi na Cikeketima cendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Kaha nga umo ueni akanjihula nguendi, “Nga omu mukemo mucinafu, kaha Njambi asa kutupaya vati? Iya asa kuviana cizango ca Njambi?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Kaha yove iya kavusamba kange, linga ulikumbulule na Njambi? Ndeho ya vuma kuyasa kuihula muntu uje uaishongele nguayo, “Nkuma vika uanjimungila muje?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Nkuma uje muka kushonga vindeho kesi na nzili yakupangesa vuje vuma muoshe muatondela ndi? Nkuma kasa kushonga vindeho vivali ha cipama cimolika ca vuma, ndeho imo yakupangesa viuma via seho, kaha ndeho ikuavo yakupangesa viuma viangoco ndi?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Kaha eci cinapu cavusunga ha vije vianalingi Njambi. Njambi uatondele kumuesa vukalu vuendi nakumuesa nzili yendi. Vuno honi uasimpile nakuyanda hali vaje uatalele na vukalu, vaje uafuililile kunongesa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Kaha naua Njambi uatondele kumuesa vumpau vuendi vuakama, vuje vuamuaniene hali yetu vaje amuesa cikeketima, yetu vaje vanavuahesa linga tutambule vumpau vuendi. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Kaha omuo tunapu vana vaje vanasana, keti lika hhakati ka Vayunda kuahi, vuno honi naua na hhakati ka vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Kaha evi vikevio Njambi uahandekele mu livulu lia Hosiya nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Vantu vaje kuvapuile vange</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Njikavasana ‘Vantu vange.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">vantu vaje kunjazangele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Njikavasana nguange, ‘vanjazanga.’<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Kaha ku cihela kuje kuvavalekele nguavo, ‘Keti mu vantu vange,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">Kuje vakavasana nguavo vantu va Njambi ua kuyoya.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Kaha Isaya uahandekele hali vaka Isaleli nguendi, “Cipue vantu va Isaleli vanalana nge museke ua ku cikuma ca mema a kalunga, vuno honi vavandende lika vakovoka. <verse eid="ROM 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Omuo Njambi akasompa vuasi vuasi vantu voshe va hano ha mavu ntsimbu imolika nakumanusula.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Ngue muje muahandekele Isaya ha kulivanga nguendi, “Nga Njambi muka nzili yoshe nge katusezeleleko vatekuluila, nge tunapu ngue Sondoma na Ngomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muzimbu Uacili na Isaleli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Kaha vikahoni tukahandeka? Tukahandeka nguetu vaje keti Vayunda vaje kuvalipuisile vakevo vavenia vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi, vavapuisile vaka vusunga ku mesho endi ha lutsilielo, <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>te kanda vantu va Njambi vaje vatondele Lishiko lia Mosesa linga livapuise vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi, kuvaliuanene. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Kaha omuo vikahoni? Omuo kuvajendamenene ha lutsilielo vuno honi hali vije vivalingile. Kaha vatsutsukile ha “livue lia kutsutsukisa.” <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Tala njikahaka livue mu Siyone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Lije likatsutsukisa vantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Livue lije likavauisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Vuno honi uoshe uje atsiliela kuli ikeye kakovu shuamua.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Vavusamba vange, vinjitonda cikuma mu mutima uange na lilombelo liange kuli Njambi vinapu vantu vange vovoke! <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Yange njinapu mukaleho uavo omuo vakevo vapua vakakulihana cikuma kuli Njambi, vuno honi kulihana kuavo keti kua mana avusunga. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Omuo kuvatantekeyele ngila ije yakapuisa Njambi vantu linga vapue vakavusunga ku mesho endi, vuno honi vakevo vaneseka kupangesa ngila yavo vavenia, ngeci, kuvalihanene vakevo vavenia ku ngila ya Njambi ije yakapuisa vantu linga vapue vaka vusunga. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Muafua Kilistu ikeye mamanusuluilo a Lishiko lia Mosesa, linga uoshe uje atsiliela vamupuise muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuovoka cinapu ca voshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Mosesa uasonekele evi hakupuisa muntu linga apue muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha kuononoka Lishiko nguendi, “Uoshe uje ononoka Lishiko akayoya.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Vuno honi visoneka vihandeka hakupua muka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi ha lutsilielo vikevio evi nguavio, “Keti ulihule yove vevenia nguove, iya honi akalonda muilu?” (Cinapu ngue uli nashulisa Kilistu ha mavu). <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>“Cipue keti ulihule yove vavenia nguove iya akaya ku vukalo vua vaka kutsa?” (Eci cinapu ngue uli nakuhumisa Kilistu ku kutsa). <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Evi vinjili nakuhandeka vikevio evi, “lizi lia Njambi lili muyehi neni, lili kukanua kove na mu mutima uove” likelio, lizi lia lutsilielo lije tuli nakuambulula. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Nga ulitavela na kanua kove nguove Yesu ikeye Muene nakutsiliela mu mutima uove nguove Njambi uamusanguile ku vatsi, ukovoka. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Muafua ha lutsilielo luetu mukemo vanatupuisa vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi, hakulitavela kuetu mukemo tunovoka. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Uoshe uje akatsiliela muli ikeye kakevu shuamua.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Omuo eci njinahandeka ha vantu voshe omuo kukuesi kuhangula hhakati ka Vayunda na Vangelengu, Kilistu ikeye Muene ua voshe, ikeye akakuisula cikuma voshe vaje vasana kuli ikeye. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Uoshe uje akasana lizina lia Muene mukumukuasa akovoka.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Vuno honi vatihoni vakasana kuli ikeye linga avakuase nga kuvatsilielele? Kaha vati vakatsiliela nga kuvovuile lizi? Kaha vatihoni vakevua lizi nga kuvaliambuluile? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Kaha vakambulula vatihoni lizi nga tunganda kuvavatumine? Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Cinapu cakuvuahelele cikuma omo tunganda vakeja nakuneha muzimbu uacili!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Vuno honi keti voshe vanatambula muzimbu uacili. Isaya vavenia alinakuhandeka nguendi, “Muene, iya uatsilielele vije vivovuile kuli yetu?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Kaha lutsilielo lukahumu hakuivua lizi, kaha na kuivua lizi likahumu hakuambulula via Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Vuno honi njihula nguange, muavusunga nkuma kuvovuile lizi ndi? Cilivene valiuvuile, omuo nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Mutambi ua lizi liavo uashandokelele mu lifuti lioshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">Majui avo ahetele naku ntsongo ya mavu oshe.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Kaha njihula naua nguange, nkuma vantu va Isaleli kuvevuisisile ndi? Mosesa ikeye vavenia uapuile uakulivanga kukumbulula nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Njikapangesa vaje keti Vayunda vaje kuhona seho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">linga vantu vange vakevue cipululu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Njikapangesa vaje keti Vayunda vakuhona mana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">linga vakanienguese vantu vange.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Kaha Isaya nakusimpa uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Vanjiuanene vaje kuvanjitondele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">njasholokele kuli vaje kuvanjihuile.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Kaha Isaya uahandekele naua hali vaka Isaleli nguendi, “Ntsimbu yoshe njikolola mavoko ange mukutambula vantu vaje vakuhona kuononoka nava vaka kutengulukila.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Cikeketima ca Njambi ku vaka Isaleli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Kaha njihula nguange, nkuma Njambi naviana vantu vendi ndi? Houe keti ngoco! Nange vene njapua njika Isaleli, mutekuluila ua Avilahama, uaku muyati ua Mbenjamine. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Njambi kavianene vantu vendi, vaje vahanguile kuhuma ha mbangelo. Yeni muatantekeya nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka mu mutambela uje uhandeka hali Eliya uje ualambelele Njambi hali vaka Isaleli nguendi, <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>“Muene, vanatsihi tunanguizi va Njambi vove, kaha vanasihula mitula yove, kaha naua vali na kutonda kunjitsiha.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Kaha Njambi uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Njalitumbikila vamala vakupua makulukazi atanu na avali (7 0 0 0) vaje kanda valemese kamponia ka mbale.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Nankuma, cinapu cuma cimo vene, vuavuno kuli civunga ca cindende ca vantu vanasalaho vaje vahanguile Njambi omuo ya kavumbi kendi. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Kuhangula cendi cinajendamena ha kavumbi kendi, keti ngue ha vije vivanalingi kuahi. Omuo nga kuhangula ca Njambi caya ngue kuli vije vivanalingi vantu, nge kavumbi kendi kukapuile kavusunga. <verse eid="ROM 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Vikahoni vantu va Isaleli kuvauanene cije vakele nakutonda. Capuile lika civunga cacindende ca vantu vaje vahanguile Njambi vakevo vaciuanene, kaha vaje vasaleleho vapuile tusinda-matuitui kukusana ca Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Njambi navahana cimbembesi cakuhona kulitavasana, mesho akuhona kumona na matuitui akuhona kuvua nakuheta kuli litangua lialelo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Kaha Ndaviti ahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Viuano viavo vipue miheto yavo, kaha vatsemo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">vanapande kuua, vanapande kuvazangamesa!<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Mesho avo apue a vupuputua linga keti vamone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">kaha vakotame miongo yavo mu tuyando tuavo ntsimbu yoshe.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Nankuma njihula nguange, omo Vayunda vatsutsukile, nkuma vauile nakunonga ndi? Houe keti ngoco! Omuo valingile vupi, kuamena kuneja kuli vaje keti Vayunda linga Vayunda vavovuile cipululu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Kaha vupi vua Vayunda vuanehele vikuisulo viakama ha mavu, kaha kuhutua kuavo kua mu Cimbembesi kuanehele vikuisulo viakama kuli vaje keti Vayunda. Ambahoni omu mukemo vikuisulo viakama cikuma omo vuingi vua Vayunda vanalivuezelela!<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuamena kuli vaje keti Vayunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Njili nakuhandeka honi kuli yeni vaje keti Vayunda. Njilinakulihalesa mu vipangi viange omuo njapua nji kanganda keni vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Hamo njasa kulingisa vantu vaku muyati uange cipululu, linga njihase kuamenako vamo. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Omuo vavavianene, kaha vantu vamo vavatenguluile linga keti vapue vitozi va Njambi, vuno honi vapue vavusamba va Njambi. Cikapua vatihoni omo vanavatambula? Cikapua ngue muono kuvakakutsa!<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Nga mbazuvuila yakulivanga ya mbolo vaihana kuli Njambi, nankuma, namukasha uoshe uamutuntu unapu uendi naua, nga mizi ya muti vaikombela kuli Njambi, kaha na mintango naua inapu yendi. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Vuno honi nga mintango imo ya ku muti ya olive yakukuna vana kuhojola, kaha muntango ua olive ua mu musenge vanainungiyako. Kaha yeni keti Vayunda munapu ngue muti uamumusenge ua olive, kaha honi mulipangela cimbembesi ca vuyoye vua Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Nankuma, kumuapandele kuyengula vaje vavahojuele ngue mintango. Vatihoni muhasa kulihalesa? Yeni munapu lika mu mintango, kumue kukuata mizi, vuno honi mizi ikeyo ili nakumikuata.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Vuno honi muhandeka ngueni, “Eyo, vuno honi ije mintango vahojuele linga vanjinungileko yange.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Eci cinapu ca vusunga. Vavahojuele omuo kuvatsilielele, vuno honi yeni muatumamene mumuhela ueni omuo munatsiliela. Vuno honi keti mulihalese ha visinganieka evi, munapande kulikolesa kaha mukale na liova. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Nga Njambi katetela Vayunda vaje vanapu ngue mintango ya cisemua, kaha musinganieka ngueni akamitetela ndi? <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Hano tumona ngozi ya Njambi nakukaluua cendi. Ikeye napu uakukaluua kuli vaje vanau, vuno honi napu muka ngozi kuli yeni nga mutualelaho mu ngozi yendi. Vuno honi nga kumulingi ngoco, kaha neni naua vakamihojolako. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Nga Vayunda vakaputuka kutsiliela naua, kaha vakavahiluisila naua mumutambela muje muvakele, omuo Njambi asa kulinga ngacije naua. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Yeni keti Vayunda munapu ngue muntango ua muti ua olive uamu musenge uje uvanahojola, kaha ngue keti mucifua cauo, vuno honi vanaunungila ku muti ua olive uakukuna. Vayunda vanapu ngue uje muti uakukuna, kaha cikapua cacasi cikuma kuli Njambi kunungilako eyi mintango ivanajokuele ku muti uayo naua.<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cikeketima ca Njambi ku vantu voshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Vavusamba vange kuli vusunga vuakushuekesa vuje njitonda linga mutantekeye, omuo vukamivindika kusinganieka ngueni munapu vakuzangama. Okukukaluua kua mitima yeni vantu va Isaleli keti ngue ku miaka yoshe kuahi, vuno honi kukakalako lika noho vaje keti Vayunda vanapumo kuija kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Omu mukemo vantu va Isaleli voshe muva kavamena. Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Muyoyesi akahuma ku Siyone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">kaha akahumisa vupi vuoshe kuvatekuluila va Yakomba.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Kaha njikalitavasana navo litavasano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">eli omo njikahumisa vupi vuavo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Omuo vanaviana Muzimbu Uacili, kaha ava Vayunda vanapu vitozi va Njambi omuo yeni keti Vayunda. Vuno honi omuo kuhangula ca Njambi vanapu vavusamba vendi omuo hali vakukuluila vavo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Omuo Njambi kekutengulula visinganieka viendi kuli vaje nahangula na kukuisula. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Ngue hali yeni keti Vayunda, kumuononokele Njambi ku senkulu, vuno honi vuavuno munatambula cikeketima ca Njambi omuo hakuhona kuononoka ca Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Mucifua cimo vene, omuo ya cikeketima cimunatambula, Vayunda honi kuvesi nakuononoka Njambi linga navakevo vatambule cikeketima ca Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Omuo Njambi napuisa vantu voshe vinzinda vakuhona kuononoka, linga amuese cikeketima kuli voshe.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kushangala Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Vufuko vua Njambi vuapua vuavuingi cikuma! Kutantekeya cendi na mana endi viapua viakulova cikuma! “Iya honi asa kulumbununa matumbe endi?” <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“Iya honi atantekeya mana a Muene?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Iya honi asa kumunangula?”<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>“Cipue iya honi uamuhanene cuma cimo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">linga amuhiluisile fueto?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Omuo ikeye uatangele viuma vioshe, kaha viuma vioshe vilinakuyoya muli ikeye nahali ikeye. Kuli Njambi kukale vumpau ku miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Vuyoye mukupangela Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Nankuma, vavusamba vange, omuo cikeketima ca Njambi cakama cikuma kuli yetu, njimilambelela nguange, lihaneni yeni vavenia kuli Njambi ngue cikombelo cakuyoya, likundikeni kuvipangi viendi nakumuvuahelesa. Okukukeko kulemesa kua vusunga kuje munapande kulinga. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Keti mulipuise ngue mu vantu vahano ha mavu, vuno honi eceleni Njambi atengulule visinganieka via mu mitima yeni. Ambahoni mukatantekeye cizango ca Njambi, vije viacili nevi vimuvuahelesa nevi via kusungama.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Omuo vuana njinatambula vua kavumbi ka Njambi, njihandeka kuli yeni voshe nguange, keti musinganieke yeni vavenia kupua vakama cikuma kupulakana muje mumunafu. Vuno honi, muapande kulikehesa muvisinganieka vieni, lihiluleni yeni vavenia ngue ku lutsilielo lueni luje luanamihana Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Tuli navilio viavingi mu muvila umo, kaha cimo na cimo cili navipangi viaco. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Mucifua cimo vene, cipue tunapu tuvavengi, tunapu muvila umolika muli Kilistu kaha yetu voshe vanatunungu kuvilio via muvila umolika. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Nankuma, tunapande kupangesa vuana vuetu vuakuliseza-seza ngue ku kavumbi ka Njambi, kaje natuhana. Nga vuana vuetu vunapu vuakuambulula vunanguizi, kaha tunapande kuambulula vunanguizi kuya ngue nalutsilielo luetu tuli naluo, <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>nga vuakupangela, kaha tunapande kupanga vene, nga vuakulongesa, tulongeseni vene, <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>nga vuakukolesa vakuetu, kaha tunapande kulinga ngoco vene. Uoshe uje mukakuhana vakuavo napande kuhana na mutima umo, kaha uje uoshe muka nzili napande kupanga cikuma na nzili, uoshe uje amuesa ngozi kuli vakuavo napande kucilinga nakuvuahelela.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vipangi via Cizango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Cizango cinapande kutungukua. Zindeni viuma vioshe vije vinapu viavipi, kakateyeni kuli vije viacili. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Lizangeni umo na mukuavo, kaha lisingimikeni umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Nankuma pangeni cikuma na nzili keti mupue vilenda. Pangeleni Muene nakulihakako na mutima uoshe. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Vuaheleleni mukutsiliela kueni, pueni vaka ku simpa mutuyando tueni, kaha lombeleni ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Lipangezeleni vije mulinavio navakueni vaka Yesu vaje vana honoua, tambuleni vangenzi mu vinjivo vieni.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Vezikiseni vaje valinakumiyandesa, eyo, vavezikiseni, kaha keti muvasinge kuahi. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Vuaheleleni navaje valinakuvuahelela, lileni navaje vali nakulila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Yoyeni mulitavasano umo na mukuavo. Keti mulihalese, vuno honi likeheseni muvipangi. Keti musinganieke yeni vavenia ngue munapu vakakuzangama.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Nga umo nakupihisila, keti umuhiluisile vupi vuendi naua. Lingeni viacili ku mesho a vantu voshe. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Lingeni viuma vioshe ngue mumunahasela nakuyoya mu ciyulo kuli muntu na muntu. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Keti mulihiluisile vupi ku vupi, vuno honi eceleni vukalu vua Njambi vucilinge. Omuo visoneka vihandeka nguavio, “Yange njikahiluisila vupi, njikavahiluisila fueto yavo, muanahandeka Muene.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Vuno honi nge muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Nga citozi cove ali na njala, muhane viakulia, nga ali nampuila, muhane mema anue, omuo hakulinga eci ulinakumulingisa linga evue shuamua.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Keti mutave vupi vumihiane, vuno honi hianeni vupi na viuma viacili.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Kusingimika vaka nzili yakama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Vantu voshe vapande kuononoka kuli vaka nzili, omuo naumo uahi asa kushika kuvanga Njambi namuhangula, kaha vaka nzili vaje valiko Njambi ikeye navahakaho. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Nankuma, uoshe uje aluisa vaka nzili kaha naluisa na vije via nashiki Njambi, kaha uoshe alinga evi alinehela cihiso ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Omuo vakakulinga muacili kuvasa kuivuila liova vakakuyula, vuno honi kuvanga vaje valinga mua mupi. Yove ku uivuila liova muntu uje alina nzili yakama ndi? Nankuma linga muacili kaha na ikeye akakushangazala, <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>omuo vanapu vangamba va Njambi valinakumipangela viacili. Vuno honi nga ulinga mua mupi, kaha vovuile liova, omuo nzili yavo yakukuzangamesa inapu ya vusunga. Vakevo vanapu vangamba va Njambi, kaha valinakuneha kuzangamesa ca Njambi kuli vaje valinga mua mupi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Nankuma ha cuma eci muapande kuononoka ku vaka nzili yakama, keti ngue hakuzangamesa ca Njambi lika kuahi, vuno honi naua omuo ha visinganieka viacili.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Eci cikeco naua mulinakufuetela lisimu, omuo vaka nzili yakama vali nakupangela Njambi omuo nga vashulisa vipangi viavo. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Nankuma fueteni vije vinapu viavo, vafueteni vieni na lisimu lia ku vufuko vueni, kaha mueseni kasingimiko kuli voshe ava.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kapandi keni kuli umo na mukuavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Keti mukale nalikongo kuli umo na mukuavo, likongo munapande kukala nalio linapande kulizanga umo namukuavo. Uoshe uje azanga mukuavo kaha nonoka lishiko. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Mashiko nguauo, “Keti ulinge vupangala, keti utsihie, keti uive, keti uliveyele cuma camukueni.” Kaha vioshe evi, navieka naua, vanavipuisa lishiko limolika nguavo, “Zanga mukueni ngue muualizanga yove vavenia.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Nga uzanga mukueni, kaha kukasa kumulinga mua mupi, nankuma, kuzanga, kukekuo kuononoka lishiko lia Mosesa lioshe.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Yeni munapande kulinga ngacijevene, omuo munatantekeya ngueni ntsimbu inahete ya kuhinduka mutulo. Omuo ntsimbu ya kutuamena ilimuyehi kupulakana muje muyakele omo tuatsilielele hakulivanga. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Vutsiki vuavuno vuhua, litangua vuavuno lituhuka. Tulikeleni kulinga viuma vije viakundama ku milima, kaha tuambateni vitua viakulua navio mumutania. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Tuendeni muacili, ngue vantu vaje valinakuyoya mu ceke ca mutania, keti kulinga kalua kakuviuano cipue kupenda, cipue kulinga vupangala, cipue lizangamena, cipue kulinga luozi cipue cipululu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Vuno honi zaleni vitua via Muene Yesu Kilistu, keti muivuilile naua cifua ceni ca vuntu na kukavangeya mashungu aco kuahi.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Keti uhise vakueni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Tambuleni vaje vanazeye mulutsilielo, vuno honi keti mulinge vimpata navo ha visinganieka viavo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>lutsilielo lua vantu vamo luvatavesa kulia nkala coshe, vuno honi vantu vamo vaje vanazeye mulutsilielo valia lika visapa sapa. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Muntu uje alia vioshe keti ayengule muntu uje ke kulia vioshe, kaha uje alia lika visapa sapa keti ahise uje alia nkala coshe, omuo Njambi ikeye namutavesa. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Yove iyajo linga uhise ngamba yambala? Kuvanga uje Muene yavo ikeye ahangula nga valinga muacili cipue vanahonoua. Omuo Muene yavo akavakolesa linga vase.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Vantu vamo vasinganieka ngue litangua limo lili naseho kupulakana matangua akuavo, kaha vakuavo naua vasinganieka nguavo matangua oshe apua hamolika. Muntu na muntu napande kukolesa mukusinganieka viendi viampua viacili. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Vaje Voshe vasinganieka seho ya litangua limo napande alinge mukusingimika Muene, uoshe uje alia cuma coshe napande ku cilia mukusingimika Muene, omuo atsetsela kuli Njambi ha kulia. Voshe vaje vaviana viakulia vimo vaviana kusingimika Muene, kaha atsetsela kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Naumo uahi haliyetu aka liyoyela ikeye vavenia, kaha naumo uahi haliyetu akalitsila ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Nga tuyoya, tulinakuyoyela kuli Muene, kaha nga tutsa, tutsila kuli Muene. Nankuma, cipue tuyoya cipue tutsa, tunapu vana va Muene. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Omo Kilistu uatsile, kaha uayoyele naua mukupua Muene ua vakakuyoya na vatsi. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Nankuma, kuli yove ukali lika visapa sapa, vikahoni uhisa mukueni? Kaha naua yove ukali vioshe, omuo vika uyenguila mukueni? Yetu voshe tukemana kumesho a Njambi na kutusompesa. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Omo vavisoneka muvisoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Mua vusunga omo njiyoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">vantu voshe vakatsikama kumesho ange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">kaha vantu voshe vakalitavela nguavo yange Njambi.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Nankuma, yetu voshe, tukahandeka vietu vavenia kumesho a Njambi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Keti utsutsuse mukueni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Nankuma tuecele kulihisa umo namukuavo. Vuno honi uapande kusinganieka linga keti uhake citsutsukiso mungila ya mukueni cipue cakumuuisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Muvumo vuange muli Muene Yesu muavusunga njitatekeya nguange kukuesi viakulia viakujuala mua lika liavio, vuno honi nga munatsiliela linga viakulia vimo vinapu viakujuala, nankuma, vipua viakujuala kuli yeni. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Nga uvulumuina vakueni omuo ha cakulia, kaha kuuesi nakumuesa cizango kuahi. Keti utave viakulia vije viulia vinongese muntu uje yanatsililile Kilistu! <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Nankuma, keti utave vije viacili ku mesho ove linga vipue nalizina lia lipi. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Omuo vu Muene vua Njambi keti ngue vunapu vuakulia na kunua kuahi, vuno honi vunapu vua vusunga na ciyulo nakujolelela mu Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Kaha nga mupangela Kilistu mungila eyi vene, muvuahesa Njambi, kaha na vantu vamutsiliela naua.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Nankuma, ntsimbu yoshe tunapande kusinganieka ha viuma vineha ciyulo navije vikuasa kukolesa umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Keti unongese vipangi via Njambi omuo havia kulia lika. Via kulia vioshe viapua via kulela, vuno honi keti muacili kulia cuma cimo cije casa kulingisa umo linga auile mu vupi. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Cuma cacili kulinga cinapu keti mulie ntsitu nakunua viniu, cipue kulinga cuma cimo cije cistustukisa mukueni. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Lutsilielo luje lu muli nalio lutulikeni hhakati keni vavenia na Njambi, nakukuisula muntu uje kevu shuamua omo a panga cuma cimo namono nguendi cacili! <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Vuno honi nga vakevo vali navimpata hali vije vialia, kaha Njambi navahisa laja omo vavilia, omuo vilinga viavo kuviakundamene ha lutsilielo. Omuo cuma coshe cije kucakundamene halutsilielo cinapu vupi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Vuaheleseni Vakueni keti Yeni Vavenia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Yetu vaje vanakolo mu lutsilielo tunapande kukuasa vaje kanda vakole mu lutsilielo hakuvakuasa kuambata viteli viavo. Kutuapandele kulivuahelesa yetu vaveni. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Vuno honi tuva voshe tuapande kuvuahelesa vakuetu mukuvalingila viacili, linga vakole mu lutsilielo. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Omuo Kilistu kalivuahelesele ikeye vavenia kuahi. Vuno honi ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo, “Kushaula kuje kuvamishauile kuneja hali yange.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Vuima vioshe vije vanasoneka mu visoneka vavisonekele linga vitulongese, linga tusimpe na kulitakamesa kuje kuvanatuhana mu visoneka linga tukale nakutsiliela. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Kaha Njambi uje ikeye ntsina ya kusimpa na kutakamesa, amihane kuyoya vuino mukati keni umo na mukuavo kuhitila muli Kilistu Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>linga mu voshe mukashangazale Njambi Ishe ya Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu na lizi limo.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muzimbu kuli Vaje keti Vayunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Nankuma, litambuleni umo namukuavo, ngue muanamitambula Kilistu, linga muhane vumpau kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Omuo njimileka nguange Kilistu vamupuisile mukakupangela Vayunda, mukumuesa nge Njambi uapua ua vusunga, mukulingisa vikulaheso viendi kuli vakukuluila vavo linga vipue via vusunga, <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>kaha naua mukulingisa vaje keti Vayunda linga vashangazale Njambi ha cikeketima cendi. Nge muvanavisoneka muvisoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Nankuma, njikakushangazala hhakati ka vaje keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">njikemba nakukushangazala.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Kaha naua nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Yeni vaje keti Vayunda joleleni hamo na vantu va Njambi!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Kaha naua nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Shangazaleni Muene, yeni voshe keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">mushangazaleni yeni vantu voshe!”<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Kaha naua Isaya ahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Mutekuluila ua Njesi akasholoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">akeja mukuyula vaje keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">kaha vakahaka kutsiliela kuavo muli ikeye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Kaha Njambi, uje ntsina ya kutsiliela, amishulise na kuvuahelela kuoshe na ciyulo omuo halutsilielo lueni muli ikeye, linga kutsiliela ceni citualeleleho kukola na nzili ya Cimbembesi Uakulela.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omuo vikahoni Paulu ua vasonekelele na kusimpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Vavusamba vange, yange vavenia njinamono nguange muavusunga yeni munashulu na vucili, kaha muli na mana oshe, kaha naua muasakulilongesa umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Vuno honi mu mukanda ou njinasimpi ha kusoneka viuma vimo njamianukisa. Njinasimpi omuo ha kapandi kaje kananiihana Njambi, <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>ha kupua ngamba ya Kilistu Yesu hakupangela vaje keti Vayunda. Njilinakupanga ngue kasasendote mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Njambi, linga vaje kenti Vayunda vapue nkombelo yakuvatambula kuli Njambi, ije ivanalelesa kuli Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Muvumo muli Kilistu Yesu, njihasa kulishasha hakupangela Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Omuo njikasimpa nakuhandeka lika vije vianalingi Kilistu kuhitila muli yange mukutuamenena vaje keti Vayunda linga vononoke Njambi. Nalingi evi muli mezi na vilinga, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>na nzili ya vikomoueso na vitakeyeso, na nzili ya Cimbembesi ca Njambi. Nankuma, kuhuma ku Yelusalema na kuheta ku Ilikiume, njinamanesa kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Cizango cange ntsimbu yoshe cinapu kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili mumitambela ije kanda vovue via Kilistu, kuteua njikatungila ha luvula luanahindi laja muntu ueka. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Ngue muvanasoneka mu visoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Vaje kuvavalekele via hali ikeye vakamumona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">kaha vaje kuvevuile, vakevuisisa.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua Paulu vuakuya ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Kaha evi vikevo vianjihonouesele vintsimbu viavingi kuija kuli yeni. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Vuno honi omo honi njamanesa vipangi viange mu vihela evi, kaha njatondele ha miaka yayingi linga njije njakumimone, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>njinatsiliela kulinga ngoco vene. Njitonda kumimona ha vungenzi vuange vuakuya ku Sepeine, linga muakunjikuase hakuya kuje, kaha njikahandeke neni mu matangua amandende lika. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Kaha hano vene njili nakuya ku Yelusama nakupangela vantu va Njambi kuje. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Omuo vikungulukilo viamu Masendonia na mu Akaya vanasinganieka kuhanako mulambu mukukuasa tuhutu hhakati ka vantu va Njambi mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Viapuile visinganieka viavo vavenia lika, vuno honi cilivene ha cuma eci, vakevo vakele na likongo lia kuvakuasa. Omuo Vayunda valipangelele vikuisulo viavo via cimbembesi na vaje keti Vayunda, kaha vaje keti Vayunda vanapande kupangesa vikuisulo viavo via vufuko mukukuasa Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Omo njinamanesa vipangi evi nakuneha vimbongo vioshe kuli vakevo vije vivanavakunguluila, kaha njikaya ku Sepeine nakumisikamesa ha vungenzi vuange vua kuya kuje. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Kaha omo njikeja kuli yeni, njatantekeya nguange njikeja nakushula kua vikuisulo via Kilistu.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Njimilambelela vavusamba vange, kuhitila muli Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu na kuhitila mu cizango ca Cimbembesi, lipandakaneni hamo nange mukunjilombelela cikuma kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Lombeleni linga njikahone kukala na vushonde kuli vakakuhona kutsiliela mu Yundeya, kaha naua vipangi viange mu Yelusalema vakavitambule vantu va Njambi vaje vali muje. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Nankuma, njikeja kuli yeni nakuvuahelela kuoshe, nga cinapu cizango ca Njambi, na kuvuahelela mukumisikamesa. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Kaha Njambi, ntsina ya ciyulo, akale neni voshe. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Vihindu via Paulu kuli vantu va mu Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Njikundika muanetu uampuevo Fuivi kuli yeni, uje muka kupangela cikungulukilo ca ku Senkili. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Mutambuleni mu lizina lia Muene nge muje muvakalingi vantu va Njambi, kaha mukuaseni vioshe vije atonda kuli yeni, omuo ikeye uapua kavusamba uacili kuli vantu vavengi na kuli yange naua.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Vihindu kuli Pilisika na Akuila, vaka kupanga nange mu vipangi via Kilistu Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>vakevo vecelele muono uavo omuo yange. Njatsetsela, keti yange lika, vuno honi naua na vikungulukilo vioshe via vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Vihindu naua ku cikungulukilo ca vaje vakakungulukila mu njivo yavo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Vihindu kuli kavusamba kange Epaenetase, uje uapuile yala uakulivanga kutsiliela muli Kilistu mu mumbonge ya Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Vihindu kuli Maliya, uje uamipangelele cikuma. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Vihindu naua kuli Andolonikase na Njuniyase, vakuetu Vayunda vaje mutuakelelele mu kamenga, vapua vakutsimana hhakati ka tunganda, kaha vapuile vaka Yesu ntsimbu kanda yange njitsiliele.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Vihindu viange kuli Ampiliatase, kavusamba uange ha kulitombola muli Muene. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Vihindu naua kuli Ambanase, mukuetu mu vipangi via Kilistu, na kuli Sitacise kavusamba kange ua cizango. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Vihindu kuli Apelese, uje kulongua cendi muli Kilistu vanacishangala. Vihindu kuli vaje vanakundama ku ntanga ya Alisitombolase. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Vihindu kuli Helondione, mukuetu Kayunda, na kuli vaka Yesu mu ntanga ya Nasisase.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Vihindu viange kuli Talafaena na kuli Talafosa vaje vapanga mu vipangi via Muene, na kuli kavusamba kange Pelesise, uje napanga cikuma vipangi via Muene. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Vihindu kuli Lufase, uje uakuhangula muli Muene, hamo na vaina vaje vakele nakunjiniunga ngue nji munendi. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Vihindu kuli Asinikilitase na Felengone na Helemese na Patolombase na Helemese na vakuetu voshe muli Yesu vali hamo navo <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Vihindu kuli Filolongese na Njuniyase na Neliase na ndumbuendi uampuevo, na kuli Olimpase na kuli vantu voshe va Njambi vaje vali hamo navo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Kaha lihinduiseni umo na mukuavo nakulitsuemba ca kulela. Vikungulukilo vioshe via Kilistu vanamimeneka.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa viakumanesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Njimilomba vamuanetu nguange, Zangameni kuli vaje vaneha kulihangunuka nakutanganesa lutsilielo lua vantu nakuluisa vilongesa vije vimuatambuile. Vashondolokeni! <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Kaha omo voshe vaje valinga viuma evi, kuvesi nakupangela Kilistu Muene yetu vuno honi vali nakupangela lika mazimo avo, kaha na mezi avo akukokueya na hendekesi yavo yakuzembeleka vakuise vantu vakuhona mulonga.<verse eid="ROM 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Omo vantu voshe vanovu kulongua kueni ku muzimbu uacili kaha acuma eci njili nakuvuahelela cikuma hali yeni. Njitonda nguange mupue vaka mana kuviuma viacili, vuno honi mpueni vakakuhona mulonga kuviuma via vupi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Kaha Njambi ua ciyulo, vuavuno akatsena Satana muintsi ya viliato viendi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Kavumbi ka Muene yetu Yesu kakale hamo neni.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Mukuetu Timoteo muvipangi, alinakumihana vihindu, na Lusiyasi na Njasone na Sosipata vakuetu Vayunda.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Kaha yange Teshase muka-kusoneka mukanda ou njamitumu vihindu muli Muene.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Ngayase, muka kunjijumbula, uje mu njivo yendi cikungulukilo cikaliuanena, na Elasitase uje mukakutulika cikuama ca nganda, namuanetu Kuatase, vanatumu vihindu viavo kuli yeni. <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Ciyulo ca Muene Yesu Kilistu cikale neni. Ameni<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo liakumanusuila lia Vishangazala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Nankuma vumpau vukale kuli Njambi! Ikeye asa kumipangesa linga mukolese mulutsilielo lueni, kuya ku muzimbu ua cili njikambulula via Yesu Kilistu, nakuya kukusolola kua vusunga vuakushueka vuje vuvashuekele hume laja. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Vuno honi vuje vusunga vanavunehe ambanza mutania muelu muvisoneka via tunanguizi va Njambi tua Njambi, nakushika ca Njambi ua miaka yoshe vanavutantekeyesa kuli vaje keti Vayunda voshe, linga voshe vatsiliele nakuononoka.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Kuli Njambi umo lika uje ua mana oshe, kukale vumpau kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu ku miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
